     <div>
<p>News of the discipline is provided on <a href="/exchange-newsletter-and-social-media"><em>The Exchange</em></a>, the society's newsletter, as well as the <a href="https://thebhc.org/member-announcements">Member Announcements</a> section of this webpage and on <a href="https://networks.h-net.org/h-business">H-BUSINESS</a>.</p>
<p>A central <a href="https://thebhc.org/calendar">calendar</a> lists dates of key BHC events and deadlines.</p>
<p>Have a job listing, call for papers, or prize announcement you'd like to share with our members? If you are a logged-in <a href="/jointhebhc">BHC member</a>, you can <a href="https://thebhc.org/node/add/announcement_by_member">post an announcement</a>.</p>
