        <div class="grid-block-links-container"><h6><a href="https://thebhc.org/enterprise-society">Enterprise &amp; Society</a>, the journal of the BHC. <a href="https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/enterprise-and-society/latest-issue">Latest issue</a>.&nbsp;</h6>
<p><em>Enterprise &amp; Society </em>offers a forum for research on the historical relations between businesses and their larger political, cultural, institutional, social, and economic contexts. The journal aims to be truly international in scope. <a href="https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/enterprise-and-society">Read more</a>.&nbsp;</p>
