<div class="grid-block-title">About the BHC</div>
   <div class="grid-block-text-wrapper">
     <p>With the generous support of donors, the Business History Conference awards scholars with various <a href="/prizes">prizes, fellowships, and grants</a>. Records of <a href="/prize-recipients">award recipients</a> are available on our website. Selection of recipients is the duty of various <a href="/prize-committees">prize committees</a> composed of BHC members.</p>
<p>The <a href="/governance">governance</a> of the BHC is shaped by its members, whose service on committees enables the society to achieve its <a href="/mission-history">mission</a> of encouraging all aspects of research, writing, and teaching about business history and about the environment in which businesses operate.&nbsp;</p>
 
